 bindings = <
// ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷   ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷           ╷

                &kp Q       &kp W       &kp E       &kp R       &kp T           &kp Y       &kp U       &kp I       &kp O       &kp P
                &mt LGUI A  &mt LSHFT S  &mt LALT D &mt LCTRL F &kp G           &kp H       &mt LCTRL J &mt LALT K &mt LSHFT L  &mt LGUI SEMI
    &trans      &kp Z       &kp X       &kp C       &kp V       &kp B           &kp N       &kp M       &kp COMMA   &kp DOT     &kp SLASH    &none
                                        &none     &lt NUMBER TAB     &lt NAV ENTER   &lt MOUSE SPACE &lt FUNC BSPC   &none
